<title>USA: Monterey Bay sets five pct shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Monterey Bay sets five pct shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>WATSONVILLE, Calif. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monterey Bay Bancorp Inc, the holding company for Monterey Bay Bank, said it received regulatory clearance to repurchase up to five percent of its outstanding common shares or 162,245 shares.</p>
<p>Repurchase would be made in open-market transactions, depending on market conditions, it said.</p>
<p>The company also said it had increased its board to 10 members from nine members.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
